+```
+
+### Source Code (repository root)
+
+```text
+plugins/
+└── graphhelm/
+    └── hooks/
+        ├── task_handoff.py          # CHANGED — `tools/call` params validation in `_mcp_stdio()` (only rule touched: admit object-valued `_meta`)
+        └── test_task_handoff.py     # CHANGED — additive test(s): `_meta` call dispatched over stdio; negative `_meta` and unknown-field cases still rejected
+
+plugins/
+└── graphhelm-codex-hooks/
+    └── hooks/
+        └── task_handoff.py          # SYNCED — byte-identical copy of the first file (distribution contract FR-007)
+```
+
+**Structure Decision**: Existing structure only. The fix lives in the one function that owns
+`tools/call` parameter validation; no new directories, modules, or files are created besides the
+`specs/001-bench/` design artifacts. The distribution contract is honored by copying the changed
+file verbatim into the Codex companion path and verifying byte equality (see quickstart.md), not
+by introducing a build step or symlink.
